; GLSmoke13Null -- GLSmoke TEX13 through the RadeonGL minigl.library on the
; null card (uaegfx in FS-UAE, 2026-11-12): GL 1.3 phase 1 every frame --
; six texture units, GL_COMBINE with dot3 through the crossbar, a cube map
; with reflection-map texgen, an ARGB32 texture rewritten every frame,
; ARGB1555 with border clamp, three units from client arrays. Nothing is
; drawn there; what it checks is the 68k build: every packet passes the
; library's checker (its log: "RadeonGL null card", "checker errors: 0"),
; GL error 0, and the program ends. The pictures: gmake test (test_tex13)
; on the Mac, GLCompat on the card.
; Needs: gmake glsmoke.
; LIMIT 300
FailAt 1000
Wait 12
Echo "=== machine ===" >DEV:Test/auto.log
CPU >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Avail >NIL: FLUSH
Assign LIBS: DEV:GLSmoke/Libs ADD
SetEnv RadeonGLLog DEV:Test/glsmoke13.log
Echo "=== GLSmoke TEX13 FRAMES=120 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
DEV:GLSmoke/GLSmoke TEX13 FRAMES=120 >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "rc=$RC" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== GLSmoke TEX13 DEPTH=32 FRAMES=60 ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
DEV:GLSmoke/GLSmoke TEX13 DEPTH=32 FRAMES=60 >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "rc=$RC" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Assign LIBS: DEV:GLSmoke/Libs REMOVE
UnSetEnv RadeonGLLog
Echo "=== the library's log (the second run) ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Type DEV:Test/glsmoke13.log >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo "=== done ===" >>DEV:Test/auto.log
Echo >DEV:Test/AutoDone done
